{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sarfees — Mobile Device Registration & Push",
    "description": "Everything the mobile team needs to wire Firebase push.\n\n## How it works\n1. Embed the Firebase config in the app (project `sarfees-f333f`): `google-services.json` (Android) / `GoogleService-Info.plist` (iOS) — from Diaa / the Firebase console.\n2. On login (and on every FCM token refresh callback), get the device token from the FCM SDK (`FirebaseMessaging.instance.getToken()` in Flutter) and POST it to the matching endpoint below. The server stores it and auto-subscribes the device to its platform topic (`all_customers` for passengers, `all_drivers` for drivers).\n3. On logout, DELETE the token so the next owner of the phone doesn't get this account's pushes.\n\nAfter that, **no more work per feature**: every server event that writes an in-app notification (offer, assigned, arrived, picked up, delivered, completed, cancelled, wallet low, rate-your-trip…) also pushes automatically. The push `data` payload carries `type` (the notification type string) and `payload` (JSON string with ids) for deep-linking.\n\n## Response meanings\n- `pushEnabled: true` — the server has Firebase credentials and will actually push (production is live).\n- `pushEnabled: false` — token stored, but the server has no Firebase credentials yet (e.g. a local dev API). Not an app error.\n- A token may be re-POSTed freely — same token from a new login simply re-homes to the new account.\n\n## Self-test (folder 4)\nRegister a REAL device token from your test phone (replace the {{...FcmToken}} variables), then fire the admin broadcast — the phone should show the notification within seconds. Passenger devices receive `all_customers` broadcasts, driver devices `all_drivers`.\n\nMock OTP everywhere: `1234`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://169.58.67.105" },
    { "key": "countryCode", "value": "+962" },
    { "key": "otp", "value": "1234" },
    { "key": "passengerPhone", "value": "790000002" },
    { "key": "driverPhone", "value": "770000002" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@sarfees.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "SarfeesAdmin2026!" },
    { "key": "passengerFcmToken", "value": "PASTE-REAL-FCM-TOKEN-FROM-PASSENGER-APP" },
    { "key": "driverFcmToken", "value": "PASTE-REAL-FCM-TOKEN-FROM-DRIVER-APP" },
    { "key": "passengerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "driverToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Passenger — request OTP",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{passengerPhone}}\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\"\n}" } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('OTP requested', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Passenger — verify OTP",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp", "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{passengerPhone}}\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}" } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('passengerToken', d.accessToken);",
            "pm.test('token saved', () => pm.expect(d.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Driver — request OTP",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/driver/request-otp", "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{driverPhone}}\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\"\n}" } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('OTP requested', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Driver — verify OTP",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/driver/verify-otp", "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{driverPhone}}\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\"\n}" } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('driverToken', d.accessToken);",
            "pm.test('token saved', () => pm.expect(d.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 Admin — login (for the self-test broadcast)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/auth/login", "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}" } },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', d.accessToken);",
            "pm.test('token saved', () => pm.expect(d.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));"
          ] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Passenger device",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Register device token (on login + token refresh)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passengerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/device-token",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{passengerFcmToken}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"android\"\n}" },
            "description": "Call after login AND from the FCM onTokenRefresh callback. Auto-subscribes the device to the `all_customers` topic. Re-POSTing the same token is safe (re-homes to the current account)."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('registered', () => pm.expect(d.registered).to.be.true);",
            "pm.test('server push is ENABLED on prod', () => pm.expect(d.pushEnabled).to.be.true);"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Unregister on logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passengerToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/device-token",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{passengerFcmToken}}\"\n}" },
            "description": "Call on logout so the device stops receiving this account's pushes."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('removed', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Driver device",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 Register device token (on login + token refresh)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{driverToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/drivers/device-token",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{driverFcmToken}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"android\"\n}" },
            "description": "Same contract as the passenger endpoint; auto-subscribes to `all_drivers`."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('registered', () => pm.expect(d.registered).to.be.true);",
            "pm.test('server push is ENABLED on prod', () => pm.expect(d.pushEnabled).to.be.true);"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 Unregister on logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{driverToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/drivers/device-token",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{driverFcmToken}}\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('removed', () => pm.response.to.be.success);"] } }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Self-test — see a push on your phone",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 Broadcast to all_customers (passenger phones)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/notification-topics/broadcast",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"topic\": \"all_customers\",\n  \"title\": \"Sarfees push test\",\n  \"body\": \"If you can read this on your phone, passenger push works.\"\n}" },
            "description": "Register a REAL token in 2.1 first (paste it into {{passengerFcmToken}}). The phone should buzz within seconds. Note: topic fan-out can take up to a minute for a token subscribed moments ago."
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('sent', () => pm.expect(d.sent).to.be.true);"
          ] } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 Broadcast to all_drivers (driver phones)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/notification-topics/broadcast",
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"topic\": \"all_drivers\",\n  \"title\": \"Sarfees push test\",\n  \"body\": \"If you can read this on your phone, driver push works.\"\n}" }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "const d = pm.response.json().data ?? pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('sent', () => pm.expect(d.sent).to.be.true);"
          ] } }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
